1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,480
Quentin Tarantino, one of the most acclaimed filmmakers of all time, known for bringing his bold ideas to life with surreal visuals and mind bending story.

2
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,480
But he wasn't always a Hollywood icon

3
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:13,780
once he was just an ordinary guy working at a video store

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:16,960
until one night he decided to rewrite his story.

5
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:46,340
Today I present you the Tarantino method.

6
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,580
To follow this process you'll need three things

7
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:53,580
a pen, a notepad and the dead of night when the world is silent and now the soul is awake

8
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:57,260
Now it begins.

9
00:00:57,260 --> 00:01:03,180
The first page is always going to be the hardest but it's really all about getting that ball rolling

10
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:07,780
Now that you've started you have to ask yourself the big scary fear monger question

11
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:20,087
what am i doing wrong be brutally honest as quentin himself would say nail it take your time dive deep it gritty it It tough but it absolutely necessary

12
00:01:20,087 --> 00:01:24,087
and when you push through, boom, you're halfway there.

13
00:01:24,087 --> 00:01:33,367
it's all out there the fears the doubts the mistakes the lessons the heartbreak all laid out bare for

14
00:01:33,367 --> 00:01:40,967
you to see. Not built up in your mind, but on paper. Tangible. Take a moment because now you have

15
00:01:40,967 --> 00:01:43,967
You have to ask yourself, how can I change it?

16
00:01:43,967 --> 00:01:45,967
We're not all Quentin Tarantino

17
00:01:45,967 --> 00:01:48,327
you might be feeling like you're all written out

18
00:01:48,327 --> 00:01:54,207
So let's make this part simple. A straight forward list. 100 ways you can change your life.

19
00:01:54,207 --> 00:01:55,567
quite a simple process

20
00:01:55,567 --> 00:01:57,247
take a mistake you've learned

21
00:01:57,247 --> 00:01:59,127
and write down a way to change it.

22
00:01:59,127 --> 00:02:07,687
repeat it over and over again push forward write it down adapt reflect learn and grow until finally

23
00:02:07,687 --> 00:02:11,927
when you ask yourself how can I change my life you'll have 100 ways to do it

24
00:02:11,927 --> 00:02:15,527
but there's one very important thing you need to remember throughout this whole night

25
00:02:15,527 --> 00:02:17,527
you gotta actually do it
